  "card": "This PR removes the legacy reverse-precedence logic in settings parsing, aligning config file setting resolution with the standard last-setting-wins rule. Because dependent PR #17493 forbids duplicate assignments to single-value settings in configuration files, this code path is redundant and the change introduces no behavioral changes. It is part of the settings simplifications tracked in issue #17508 and depends on PRs #16545, #17493, and #17580.",
